spesgpu_mhz=1025 and 1115 (CX TURBO / TURBO_NO_CPR, MX SVS); the census tells clears from copies.

all45 (sysmem, shadow copies gone): ~49 ms of GPU time a frame at 775 MHz, ~70 draws and ~20 large
CP_BLITs, user: "better than all43". gpucc-khaje rate_max: VDD_L2_HIGH 1025 MHz, HIGH_L1 1114.8 MHz.
Live FDT: rwcx = pm6125_s3_level, rwmx = pm6125_s5_level (vlvl, levels 16..512); TURBO 384,
TURBO_NO_CPR 416. A VCO past 1.8 GHz needs MX VDD_LOW (SVS 128). The census now counts CP_BLITs with
RB_2D_BLIT_CNTL (0x8c00) SOLID_COLOR (bit 7) as clears, with their pixels.

